"text":"Naming (ADR-0010): helpers are named after the Origami ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"patch"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", bare (no prefix) —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"disambiguate with the module (","type":"text"},{"code":"OrigamiPatterns.Interaction","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") if it ever collides. This one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doesn’t clash with anything in SwiftUI.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Exposes the Interaction patch’s output ports as bindings\/callbacks so downstream SwiftUI"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"composes off them, matching the graph:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"down"},{"text":" — ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" while a finger is on the layer,","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"position","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — the touch point, in the layer’s coordinate space,","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"onTap","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"code":"onDoubleTap","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"code":"onLongPress","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — discrete pulses."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only the gesture for an output you actually request is attached — so a tap-only layer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carries only a tap recognizer (no stray drag), which keeps gesture arbitration clean."}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swami\/interaction"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"role":"collection","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","title":"Swami","abstract